But wait: Math.max(9300, ...[], 0) is equivalent to Math.max(9300, 0) which is 9300. Actually, the code is: Math.max(9300, ...Array.from(usedPorts).filter(p => p >= 9300 && p < 9400), 0)

If the filter returns empty array, then ...[] spreads nothing, so it's Math.max(9300, 0) = 9300. That's fine.

